OL,3,GNEWSAKnife accused 'looked online at
OL,4,Aincel ideologist'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenage boy who stabbed a girl at a
OL,7,Fschool searched the internet for a man
OL,8,Fconsidered to be an early adopter of
OL,9,Fincel and manosphere culture, a jury
OL,10,Fhas heard.
OL,12,FThe 15-year-old girl was knifed in the
OL,13,Fback at Thorpe St Andrew School near
OL,14,FNorwich on 11 March.
OL,16,FSpeaking at King's Lynn Crown Court,
OL,17,Fthe prosecution said examination of the
OL,18,F16-year-old defendant's phone showed
OL,19,Fsearches for Elliot Rodger, described
OL,20,Fto jurors as an "early influence on
OL,21,Fincel and manosphere culture".
